/! Sub-navigation in the top bar: switch between the chart and the table, each
/! its own URL. The parameter sliders sit at the right edge - inline on desktop,
/! behind a dropdown on mobile.
/!
/! py-2 on a phone: the row is 40px high, because the two icon buttons keep a
/! tap target of that size. An equal padding puts the row in the middle of the
/! bar. pt-2/pb-3 had made the bar 4px higher than it has to be, and it had
/! pushed the row up by 4px.
.flex.items-center.gap-4.py-2.lg:landscape:py-5
  .flex-1.min-w-0
    = render Nav::Sub::Component.new(abbreviate: false) do |c|
      - c.with_items nav_items

  /! Amber warning next to the parameters it qualifies: the projection they feed
  /! rests on less than a year of measured data. Stays visible on mobile too,
  /! where the sliders themselves move into the dropdown to its right. The
  /! title bar has a dot on its button instead.
  - if projection_uncertain
    span[
      class=['shrink-0 cursor-help text-amber-300 dark:text-amber-400', phone_class]
      data-controller='tooltip'
      data-tooltip-touch-value='true'
      title=t('amortization.index.uncertain_prognosis')
      aria-label=t('amortization.index.uncertain_prognosis')
    ]
      = icon 'triangle-exclamation', class: 'fa-lg block'

  /! Desktop: the sliders live directly in the bar (light text on indigo).
  /! Outside the detail frame, so they stay put across auto-submits.
  .hidden.lg:landscape:block.shrink-0
    = render Amortization::Controls::Component.new(period_years:, interest_rate:, view:, variant: :bar)

  /! Shortcut to the cash-flow settings, where the figures behind the
  /! calculation are maintained. Shown to everyone who may see the page; the
  /! settings page itself requires admin, so a non-admin lands on a hint to log
  /! in. Sits at the far right on desktop (after the inline sliders). A phone
  /! with a title bar has it there instead, for an admin alone (see
  /! AmortizationController#title_bar_action).
  = link_to helpers.settings_cash_flows_path,
            class: [phone_class, 'shrink-0 rounded-md p-2 text-gray-300 hover:bg-indigo-500 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-indigo-950/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-300 dark:focus:ring-gray-400 focus:ring-offset-0'],
            data: { controller: 'tooltip' },
            title: t('amortization.index.manage_cash_flows'),
            'aria-label': t('amortization.index.manage_cash_flows') do
    = icon 'gear', class: 'fa-xl block'

  /! Mobile: the same sliders behind a button that opens a sheet - no room
  /! inline.
  div class=options_class
    = render Amortization::Options::Component.new(period_years:, interest_rate:, view:, projection_uncertain:)
